 "notes": "Answers: each address is one line as the form prints it ('street, city, ST ZIP'); a foreign address also fills the country, province and postal code boxes beneath it (a US address leaves them blank). responsible_ein is written only when it is an EIN (12-3456789): an individual's SSN or ITIN never goes on the form ('By hand' leaves the box for the signer). A 'No' to lines 1 to 3 leaves its box blank. The tax-exempt box, the signature and its date are left for the signer. The XFA layer is dropped by the filler so the filled boxes show.",
